// Arduino Wokwi Simulation (v0.2.6)
// Repo: https://github.com/YuchengCai/Skill-HardwarEasySim-Wokwi.git
// Triggers: arduino/wokwi/uno/单片机 keywords, .ino/wokwi.toml/diagram.json files, @wokwi

## Workflow

1. Generate .ino + read core/uno/components.md → diagram.json + wokwi.toml
2. ./core/scripts/compile.sh <dir>
3. User: F1 → "Wokwi: Start Simulation"
4. Verify with user
5. arduino-cli board list → upload --port <PORT> --fqbn <FQBN> <dir>
6. --monitor for auto serial capture

## Version Check

Check GitHub releases on activation. If newer, offer auto-update: git clone + install.sh
